      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIRE AND PASSION (2) was only 4.5 metres from Palladium in sixth last time in the Group One Derby over 2680m at this track. Ideally drawn and can make amends in this far easier race. BENNYDASOOK (8) had been racing in great heart then kept the ball rolling last start when he scored by a head over 1660m at this track. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Finds a suitable assignment and will take plenty of beating once more. BITE THE EAR MIKE (9) is better than his last-start tenth over 2138m at this track. KIKI MEISTER (1) is worth another chance after a last-start tenth over 1609m at Menangle two-and-a-half weeks ago.",
